k as the drinking of thirsty camels.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"56:56","t":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"56:57","t":"We have created you, so why do you not believe?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"56:58","t":"Have you seen that which you emit?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"56:59","t":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"56:60","t":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"56:61","t":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":61,"sd":null},{"k":"56:62","t":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"56:63","t":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"56:64","t":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"56:65","t":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"56:66","t":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"56:67","t":"Rather, we have been deprived.\"","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"56:68","t":"And have you seen the water that you drink?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"56:69","t":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"56:70","t":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"56:71","t":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"56:72","t":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"56:73","t":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"56:74","t":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"56:75","t":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"56:76","t":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":76,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":54,"surahs":[56],"sajdah":false}